ffice\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The club does not meet between mid July and early September.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"The club does not meet between mid July and early September\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Most members take leave.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"most members take leave\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The canteen is closed for cleaning.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"the canteen is closed for cleaning\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Play resumes on the first Tuesday of term.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"Play resumes on the first Tuesday of term\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The members have learned to leave the boards set up rather than pack them away.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"Over the years the members have learned to leave the boards set up rather than pack them away\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The club does not use a rating system.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"Instead of a rating system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"the club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Members who win a game move up one place.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"Members who win a game move up one place\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The person beaten by a member who wins a game moves down one place.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"the person they beat moves down one place\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The club was invited to play a county side in one wet autumn.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"In one wet autumn the club was invited to play a county side\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"One apprentice agreed to play on the top board at two days' notice.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"one apprentice agreed to play on the top board at two days' notice\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"It took the apprentice the whole weekend to prepare.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"It took him the whole weekend to prepare\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice studied openings he had never used.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"he studied openings he had never used\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice lost his notes on the train.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"He also lost his notes on the train\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice arrived on time.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"he arrived on time\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice shook hands and sat down.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"He shook hands, sat down\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The game was adjourned.\",\n      \"line\": 20,\n      \"span\": \"the game was adjourned\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The arbiter counted the material.\",\n      \"line\": 20,\n      \"span\": \"the arbiter counted the material\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice was a pawn ahead.\",\n      \"line\": 20,\n      \"span\": \"the apprentice was a pawn ahead\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice offered a draw.\",\n      \"line\": 20,\n      \"span\": \"offered a draw\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The county side accepted the draw.\",\n      \"line\": 20,\n      \"span\": \"which the county side accepted\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The county side gave the club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time.\",\n      \"line\": 24,\n      \"span\": \"the county side gave the club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice travelled home.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"He travelled home\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The apprentice told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The club grew to thirty members.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"the club grew to thirty members\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"From then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"from then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":78617,"type":"result","duration_ms":84484,"uuid":"32226663-4cee-4a29-891f-94a9c80d5545","ttft_stream_ms":886,"time_to_request_ms":103,"first_content_frame_ms":887,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
